Ai and Nobu were friends when they were kids, but they lost touch after her family moved away."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She came to Tokyo for college, and offered a helping hand (and her apartment) to her old friend in his time of need."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young woman who treats everyone she meets with equal kindness, she practically exudes an aura of purity. Sometimes it's hard to tell if she's really just that nice, or maybe a little naive."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Smart and athletic, she may seem perfect at first, but she can be surprisingly stubborn at times."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She also has a more laid-back, casual side that she only shows in private, and to those she truly trusts."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ai's kind heart can sometimes get her in trouble. She has a habit of throwing her all into helping people, treating their problems as her own, while forgetting to take care of herself."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c88704"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/62/627ca645b9aa45a1f0e0e65c365c32e75cf5b21b4b9f81c088b30ed0c775580b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a4/a4d6e8e291379bd43afdf58fadbbba3c7c4dabb2e7d4523b6af110796c66512f.webp","width":256,"height":170,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"水瀬 よしの","creatorId":"vndb:s20618","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s20618","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s20618","name":"水瀬 よしの","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:85005","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c91259","characterName":"雪城 渚","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c91259"},"originalCharacterName":"雪城 渚","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1224"